1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sources:
2 CONT * Johannes Svendsen Riise and Ingeborg Torjersdatter's Marriage Register: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/15897/19
2 CONT * Johannes Svendsen Riise's Burial Register: https://digitalarkivet.arkivverket.no/en-gb/gen/vis/267/pg00000001840242
