2 GIVN Inger Pallesdatter
2 SURN Kolnes
2 _MARNM Tjora
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1766
2 PLAC Nor-Kolnes, Haaland, Rogaland, Norge
2 ADDR
1 BAPM
2 DATE 23 JAN 1766
2 PLAC Haaland, Rogaland, Norge
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE NOV 1812
