1 NAME Berta Isaksdatter /Helland/
2 GIVN Berta Isaksdatter
2 SURN Helland
2 _MARNM Sande
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1752
2 PLAC Helland bruk 9 Sola s140 nr 7.1
2 ADDR
1 BAPM
2 DATE 2 FEB 1752
